        {
         "id": "c92d0bf",
         "elType": "widget",
         "isInner": false,
         "widgetType": "html",
         "settings": {
          "html_code": "<ul class=\"mrd-services__list\" data-services-list>\n<li class=\"mrd-services__item\" data-service-item>\n  <button class=\"mrd-services__trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__num\">۰۱</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__name\">استراتژی و مشاوره</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__tag\">Strategy</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__plus\"></span>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"mrd-services__body\">\n    <p class=\"mrd-services__desc\">[توضیح خدمت] — تحلیل بازار، طراحی مدل کسب‌وکار و نقشه‌ی راه رشد.</p>\n    <a class=\"mrd-btn mrd-btn--text\" href=\"#contact\"><span class=\"mrd-btn__label\">دریافت مشاوره</span><span class=\"mrd-btn__circle\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\"><path d=\"M19 12H5m0 0 6 6m-6-6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a>\n  </div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"mrd-services__item\" data-service-item>\n  <button class=\"mrd-services__trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__num\">۰۲</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__name\">توسعه‌ی فناوری</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__tag\">Technology</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__plus\"></span>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"mrd-services__body\">\n    <p class=\"mrd-services__desc\">[توضیح خدمت] — معماری نرم‌افزار، پلتفرم‌های ابری و محصولات دیجیتال مقیاس‌پذیر.</p>\n    <a class=\"mrd-btn mrd-btn--text\" href=\"#contact\"><span class=\"mrd-btn__label\">دریافت مشاوره</span><span class=\"mrd-btn__circle\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\"><path d=\"M19 12H5m0 0 6 6m-6-6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a>\n  </div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"mrd-services__item\" data-service-item>\n  <button class=\"mrd-services__trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__num\">۰۳</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__name\">مهندسی و اجرا</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__tag\">Engineering</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__plus\"></span>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"mrd-services__body\">\n    <p class=\"mrd-services__desc\">[توضیح خدمت] — مدیریت پروژه‌های پیچیده‌ی مهندسی از طراحی تا تحویل.</p>\n    <a class=\"mrd-btn mrd-btn--text\" href=\"#contact\"><span class=\"mrd-btn__label\">دریافت مشاوره</span><span class=\"mrd-btn__circle\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\"><path d=\"M19 12H5m0 0 6 6m-6-6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a>\n  </div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"mrd-services__item\" data-service-item>\n  <button class=\"mrd-services__trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__num\">۰۴</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__name\">تحول دیجیتال</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__tag\">Transformation</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__plus\"></span>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"mrd-services__body\">\n    <p class=\"mrd-services__desc\">[توضیح خدمت] — بازطراحی فرآیندها و سیستم‌ها برای سازمان‌های داده‌محور.</p>\n    <a class=\"mrd-btn mrd-btn--text\" href=\"#contact\"><span class=\"mrd-btn__label\">دریافت مشاوره</span><span class=\"mrd-btn__circle\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\"><path d=\"M19 12H5m0 0 6 6m-6-6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a>\n  </div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"mrd-services__item\" data-service-item>\n  <button class=\"mrd-services__trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__num\">۰۵</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__name\">سرمایه‌گذاری و رشد</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__tag\">Investment</span>\n    <span class=\"mrd-services__plus\"></span>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"mrd-services__body\">\n    <p class=\"mrd-services__desc\">[توضیح خدمت] — ساختاردهی مالی، جذب سرمایه و توسعه‌ی بازارهای جدید.</p>\n    <a class=\"mrd-btn mrd-btn--text\" href=\"#contact\"><span class=\"mrd-btn__label\">دریافت مشاوره</span><span class=\"mrd-btn__circle\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\"><path d=\"M19 12H5m0 0 6 6m-6-6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a>\n  </div>\n</li></ul>",
